          "viz": "<svg viewBox='0 0 660 150' role='img' aria-label='五敏评价：从等级到临界条件再到作业参数' style='width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:12px 0;border:1px solid #DDD8CB;border-radius:10px;background:#fff' font-family=\"system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><rect x='0' y='0' width='660' height='150' fill='#FBFaf6'/><text x='12' y='20' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b'>等级 → 临界条件 → 参数约束：缺了中间一环，实验结论就用不到现场</text><rect x='30' y='36' width='180' height='92' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='44' y='54' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>五类敏感性等级</text><text x='44' y='72' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>速敏 弱 · 水敏 中</text><text x='44' y='88' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>酸敏 弱 · 碱敏 弱</text><text x='44' y='104' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>盐敏 中</text><text x='44' y='120' font-size='8' fill='#c9613f'>（只到等级，无法落地）</text><line x1='212' y1='82' x2='244' y2='82' stroke='#8a8f80' stroke-width='1.4'/><polygon points='244,82 238,78.5 238,85.5' fill='#8a8f80'/><rect x='246' y='36' width='180' height='92' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='260' y='54' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>临界条件</text><text x='260' y='72' font-size='8.5' fill='#2f7d6b'>水敏：临界矿化度 15000</text><text x='260' y='88' font-size='8.5' fill='#2f7d6b'>盐敏：矿化度降幅 ≤ 30%</text><text x='260' y='104' font-size='8.5' fill='#2f7d6b'>速敏：临界流速 8 m/d</text><text x='260' y='120' font-size='8' fill='#2f7d6b'>（可换算成参数约束）</text><line x1='428' y1='82' x2='460' y2='82' stroke='#8a8f80' stroke-width='1.4'/><polygon points='460,82 454,78.5 454,85.5' fill='#8a8f80'/><rect x='462' y='36' width='186' height='92' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='476' y='54' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>作业参数约束</text><text x='476' y='72' font-size='8.5' fill='#2f7d6b'>滤液矿化度 ≥ 20000</text><text x='476' y='88' font-size='8.5' fill='#2f7d6b'>投产压差分段控制</text><text x='476' y='104' font-size='8.5' fill='#2f7d6b'>采液强度 ≤ 临界流速</text><text x='476' y='120' font-size='8' fill='#2f7d6b'>（可直接下作业指令）</text><text x='12' y='142' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>实验结论的价值在于能换算：不能落地的结论等于没有结论</text></svg><div class='viz-cap'>图：五敏评价：从等级到临界条件再到作业参数</div>"
        },
