          "viz": "<svg viewBox='0 0 660 168' role='img' aria-label='措施与敏感性匹配：同时检查配伍冲突' style='width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:12px 0;border:1px solid #DDD8CB;border-radius:10px;background:#fff' font-family=\"system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><rect x='0' y='0' width='660' height='168' fill='#FBFaf6'/><text x='12' y='20' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b'>匹配不是查表：单项都对症，组合起来可能互相打架（配伍性必须查）</text><rect x='30' y='34' width='150' height='46' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='44' y='54' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>入井液体系</text><text x='44' y='72' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>防水敏：矿化度 + 抑制</text><rect x='190' y='34' width='150' height='46' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='204' y='54' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>暂堵剂 + 加量</text><text x='204' y='72' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>控滤失：粒径匹配</text><rect x='350' y='34' width='150' height='46' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='364' y='54' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>射孔负压</text><text x='364' y='72' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>清压实带：负压值</text><rect x='510' y='34' width='138' height='46' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='524' y='54' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>投产压差</text><text x='524' y='72' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>控速敏：分段升压</text><text x='30' y='98' font-size='10' fill='#3d4a48'>配伍性检查（组合层面的硬约束）</text><rect x='30' y='106' width='290' height='28' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='44' y='124' font-size='8.5' fill='#2f7d6b'>✔ 暂堵剂与入井液配伍：合格</text><rect x='330' y='106' width='318' height='28' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='344' y='124' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>✘ 阴离子体系 + 阳离子暂堵剂：絮凝，剔除</text><text x='30' y='148' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>单项对症不等于组合可用：配伍冲突在单项检查里看不出来</text><text x='12' y='162' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>匹配结果要说明「针对哪类敏感性」：措施不是越多越好，是对症才有用</text></svg><div class='viz-cap'>图：措施与敏感性匹配：同时检查配伍冲突</div>"
        },
        {
          "name": "总伤害叠加计算",
